<section id="services" style="color: #F4EEE2; padding: 128px 24px">
<div style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 280px), 1fr)); gap: 32px 64px; align-items: start">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #5B8CFF; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 14px"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #5B8CFF"></span>WHAT WE DO</div>
<div style="grid-column: span 2; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px" class="editorial-main">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.8vw, 60px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #8FB0FF; font-weight: 700">From AI ambition<br>to accountable results.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #F4EEE2; max-width: 680px">We help leaders turn data and AI investments into outcomes they can measure, govern and defend — from first strategy conversation to production at enterprise scale.</p>
<div style="padding-top: 8px"><a href="/#contact" style="display: inline-block; background: #5B8CFF; color: #0B1020; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 700; padding: 16px 28px; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 0.12em">BOOK A PLATFORM ASSESSMENT</a></div>
</div>
</div>
